"help.accuracy.body" = "Results are estimates from marked video timestamps. Event selection and altered timing can bias them. OpenJump is not clinically validated.";
"help.privacy.title" = "On-device privacy";
"help.privacy.body" = "Analysis stays on this device. No account or backend is used. Only confirmed measurements and their event timestamps are saved; the video and its URI are not saved in History.";
"help.storage.title" = "Keeping your data";
"help.storage.body" = "Keep original videos separately. Uninstalling the app can delete its saved data. Updating without uninstalling should preserve data; check your history after updating.";
"help.scope.title" = "Included in this build";
"help.scope.body" = "Five temporal jump protocols using imported SDR video. Camera capture, Body Tracking, horizontal measurement and grouped trial statistics are not included. Another trial creates a separate measurement.";

