"help.guide.prepare" = "Choose one of the five illustrated protocols and select an active athlete before importing. The protocol defines which events you must mark, and the athlete owns the saved result. You can change the protocol before a video is indexed.";
"help.guide.import" = "Import a local video clip from Photos or Files. The original file is never modified. If indexing fails, try another original clip.";
"help.guide.preview" = "Use play to move along the video timeline, then pause and wait for the exact source frame. Step one frame at a time with Previous and Next, or scrub the timeline to reach an event. Only a displayed exact frame can be marked. Preview images are for navigation only.";
"help.guide.mark" = "Mark each required event in the shown order, on its exact source frame. Timing comes from the source frame timestamps, not from a nominal frame rate. Review every mark before continuing.";
"help.guide.save" = "Declare real-time recording first, then calculate and review the result. Confirm saving to keep the measurement. Saved results appear in History, and measuring another trial reuses the same video as a separate measurement.";
"help.guide.recovery" = "If an exact frame cannot be shown or the preview is unavailable, retry loading or re-attach the preview. Check the file and review the event order. No adjustment factor can repair a wrong mark or an unsuitable file.";
"help.guide.timing" = "Video timestamps alone do not prove physical timing. Do not confirm slow-motion, speed-changed, or unknown-timing clips as real time. Results from retimed files are not valid.";
"help.guide.data" = "Only confirmed saves are kept, with their event timestamps. Original videos, their locations, and unconfirmed edits are not stored. Closing or restarting the app can discard unconfirmed work. Exports create CSV or JSON copies and cannot restore data. Apple exports are not compatible with Android backups.";
